    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional one bedroom dual aspect top floor apartment with a stylish interior and a south facing balcony ideally located in a quiet cul-de-sac.\n\nThis stunning property features an L shaped entrance hall with laminate floors, sophisticated built in storage and a hotpress. The dual aspect living room is a light filled space with laminate floors, ornate coving, three sash windows, a Murphy bed, built in storage, a cast iron radiator and and access to a south facing balcony making it the perfect place to relax. The open plan high spec kitchen & dining area has been recently upgraded & enjoys a tiled floor, splashback tiling, plenty of counter & cupboard space and two windows. The bathroom has been recently refurbished to a very high standard and boasts a tiled floor, partially tiled walls, a towel radiator and built in storage. The accommodation is completed by a spacious double bedroom with laminate floors, picture railings, a sash window, a walk-in-wardrobe and space for a home office. This amazing property also benefits from an underground car space.\n\nRosedale is ideally located in a quiet cul-de-sac set along the banks of the River Camac. There are a host of amenities in Inchicore village including cafes, bars and shops. The LUAS is a short stroll away making the city centre easily accessible. The Grand Canal, Phoenix Park and Memorial Gardens are all close by providing excellent outdoor leisure facilities. The new children's hospital at St. James's is also within walking distance.\n\nFeatures:\nYear of construction 2000\nService charge 2,313.66. \nNo rent caps\nTop floor\nSecure car space\nRecently refurbished\nSash windows\nHigh spec kitchen & bathroom\nWalk-in-wardrobe\nDual aspect"
      },
